unit lawtwin.github.handwritten

-- Written once by `lawtwin import openapi`, and yours from then on: the
-- importer never writes this file again. Each definition answers one
-- operation the importer could not model. Replace its body with what the
-- service does, over the model's State; until then it fails with
-- Unmodelled. An operation added to the document later needs a definition
-- here, and the importer names it. The model's types are written
-- qualified, as model.Pet, so a new import does not break this unit.

import lawtwin.github.model as model (ApiError, State)

-- Every operation is modelled; this unit has nothing to answer yet.
function nothingHandWritten (u :: Unit) -> Unit is unitValue end function

end unit
